# Both values below are PUBLIC by design (Supabase's anon key is meant to be
# shipped to the browser — real security comes from the Row Level Security
# policies in supabase/schema.sql, not from hiding this key). Safe to commit
# a filled-in .env.production later; never commit the *service role* key
# anywhere in this frontend project if one gets added for a future backend.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
